> could not open default font 'fixed'

> XIO fatal IO error 54 ....."

This is not either RH 7.1 or alpha specific.

> Any explications ??

Many.  You either:

- failed to start xfs ('service xfs status')
- your /etc/X11/XF86Config (or XF86Config-4) attempts to query
  on a wrong socket (should be 'FontPath "unix/:7100"')
- you have a mess in /etc/X11/fs/config
- you are missing some fonts.alias and/or fonts.dir files
  in some of font directories
- you failed to install fonts in question

or any combinations of the above or possibly something else.  Detailed
reasons behind of any of these require a closer investigation.

RH 7.1 for Alpha has as for today around 320 MB worth of updates, not
counting sources, and XFree is among of these (although current 4.1.0-15
is known to be bad for text consoles at least with some cards and I had
better results with 4.2.0 from "rawhide") and hunting for bugs without
applying updates first is a waste of time.

  Michal


